      },
      "text": "\n## A ceremony for two at Iguazú Falls\n\nIguazú Falls comprises 275 streams and cascades. The sound of the water, the rainforest and the view of the falls create a dramatic natural backdrop for the ceremony and photo shoot.\n\nThe trip lasts three days. You’ll stay at Belmond das Cataratas inside the national park, get ready for the ceremony with a professional make-up artist, have a photo shoot at the falls and explore both the national park and the Bird Park.\n"
